    "features": {
      "type":"suntneew-pdp-story",
      "blocks": {
        "overview":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-kb700-2026-pdp-01-overview.png","image_alt":"KB700 fan jump starter overview","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Four tools, one kit","heading":"A practical companion for the moments you did not plan for.","body":"<p>KB700 combines a 12V jump starter, high-speed air duster, USB device charging and 2W emergency light. The product visual stays focused on the device; the supporting details below explain exactly what each function does.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "specifications":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-kb700-2026-pdp-02-specifications.png","image_alt":"KB700 core specifications","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Core specifications","heading":"The documented essentials, in one place.","body":"<p>KB700 is specified at <strong>7,200mAh / 26.64Wh</strong>, <strong>1,000A peak</strong>, <strong>500A starting current</strong> and up to <strong>105,000 RPM</strong> of air-duster speed. Use the full Specifications panel for temperature, ports and physical dimensions.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "starting":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-kb700-2026-pdp-03-starting.png","image_alt":"KB700 12V engine compatibility","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"12V starting support","heading":"Ready for compatible gas and diesel vehicles.","body":"<p>For compatible 12V vehicle batteries, KB700 is documented for engines up to <strong>6.0L Gas</strong> or <strong>4.0L Diesel</strong>, with <strong>1,000A peak</strong> and <strong>500A starting current</strong>. A full charge is rated for <strong>up to 25 starts</strong>; actual results vary with vehicle, battery health and temperature.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "wind":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-kb700-2026-pdp-04-wind.png","image_alt":"KB700 three-speed air duster motor","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Three-speed air duster","heading":"Choose the airflow that suits the job.","body":"<p>The brushless fan has three documented speed levels: <strong>30,000 RPM</strong> for up to 18 minutes, <strong>70,000 RPM</strong> for up to 8 minutes and <strong>100,000 RPM</strong> for up to 4.5 minutes. Maximum specification: <strong>105,000 RPM / 360W / 550g wind pressure</strong>.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "vehicle_cleaning":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-kb700-2026-pdp-05-vehicle-cleaning.jpg","image_alt":"KB700 outdoor and vehicle cleaning uses","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Outdoor cleanup","heading":"Clear leaves, light snow and loose debris before the drive.","body":"<p>Use the air-duster function for light, dry debris around the vehicle and outdoor gear. Keep the jump starter, clamps and ports dry; this product is not presented as waterproof or IP rated.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "detail_cleaning":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-kb700-2026-pdp-06-detail-cleaning.jpg","image_alt":"KB700 detailed cleaning of vents and window tracks","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Detail cleaning","heading":"A compact way to reach the places cloths miss.","body":"<p>The included air nozzle helps direct airflow for car vents, window tracks, seats and dry dusty surfaces. Start at a lower setting and avoid blowing debris toward eyes, moving parts or electronics.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "controls":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-kb700-2026-pdp-07-controls.jpg","image_alt":"KB700 controls ports and jump-start connection","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Controls and ports","heading":"Everything you need is marked on the device.","body":"<p>KB700 has a Type-C charging input, USB-A device output, EC5 jump-start port, fan control, lighting control and power key. The below specification table gives the supported <strong>5V/2A</strong> input and output limits.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "safeguards":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-kb700-2026-pdp-08-safeguards.jpg","image_alt":"KB700 smart clamp safeguards","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Intelligent clamp protection","heading":"Clear clamp guidance before you start.","body":"<p>The EC5 smart clamp uses a <strong>10AWG</strong> cable and status/buzzer guidance. Its documented protection logic includes reverse polarity, short circuit, overcharge, over-discharge, over-current, overheating, high/low input voltage and timeout conditions.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "steps":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-kb700-2026-pdp-09-steps.jpg","image_alt":"Four KB700 jump-start steps","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Four-step starting","heading":"Connect carefully, then start the vehicle.","body":"<p>Make sure KB700 is at least <strong>50%</strong> charged. Insert the clamp plug, connect red to positive and black to negative, wait for the green indication and start. Remove the clamp within 30 seconds after the vehicle starts.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "charging":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-kb700-2026-pdp-10-charging.png","image_alt":"KB700 USB device charging scene","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Device charging","heading":"Keep a phone or small device within reach.","body":"<p>USB-A output supports everyday emergency charging at <strong>5V/2A</strong>. Recharge KB700 through the Type-C port at <strong>5V/2A</strong> in about four hours. Use the supplied USB-A to Type-C cable or an equivalent compatible cable.</p>","variant_match":""}}
      },
